       "en": "**Benefits** are a big deal in the US, because health insurance usually comes from your job. Look for: **health / dental / vision insurance**, **PTO** (paid time off: vacation and sick days), a **401(k)** (a retirement savings plan, sometimes with a “match”, where the employer adds money too), **CE** (continuing education, paid classes for your license), and for sales jobs, **commission** (extra money for each sale) or **bonuses**.",
