       "en": "Good meetings end with **action items**: who does what, by when. Someone (often the manager) says “**So, just to recap…**” and lists them: “Claire will call the sensor company **by** Wednesday. Mia will send the recall texts **by the end of the week**.” Notice **by** + a day = no later than that day. “Until” is different: “The office is closed **until** Monday” = closed all the time before Monday.",
       "fr": "Les bonnes réunions se terminent par des « action items » : qui fait quoi, et pour quand. Quelqu’un (souvent le manager) dit « So, just to recap… » et les liste : « Claire will call the sensor company by Wednesday. Mia will send the recall texts by the end of the week. » Remarque : by + un jour = au plus tard ce jour-là. « Until » est différent : « The office is closed until Monday » = fermé tout le temps jusqu’à lundi.",
