     "model": "Subject: Question: switching my Friday shift\n\nHi Tony,\n\nI hope you had a great weekend! I have a doctor’s appointment this Friday afternoon. Would you be able to let me switch my Friday shift with Jordan’s Saturday shift? Jordan already said it works for him.\n\nLet me know if that’s okay with you.\n\nThanks so much,\nClaire\n\n\nSubject: Following up: inventory list\n\nHi Sam,\n\nJust following up on my email from Monday about the inventory list for the phone accessories. Would you mind sending it when you get a chance? I need it by Thursday to place the order.\n\nThanks a lot!\nClaire"
