       "en": "Sometimes you can’t give the customer what they want. The trick is to **focus on what you CAN do**, not what you can’t. ❌ “We can’t take returns without a receipt.” ✅ “**What I can do** is offer you store credit for the full amount.” ❌ “The doctor doesn’t have time today.” ✅ “**The earliest I can get you in** is tomorrow at 9. Would that work?”",
