     "text": "Employee: Claire Martin – Dental Hygienist\nReviewer: Lisa Moreno, Office Manager\nPeriod: First 90 days\n\nOverall rating: Exceeds expectations\n\nStrengths\nClaire has quickly become one of our most requested hygienists. Patients describe her as “gentle”, “patient” and “so easy to talk to”, and she was mentioned by name in three five-star Google reviews. Her periodontal charting is thorough and accurate. She also stepped up during the week our front desk was short-staffed, answering phones and checking in patients without being asked.\n\nAreas for growth\nClaire’s afternoon appointments often run 10–15 minutes behind schedule. This seems to come from very detailed patient education. We appreciate how much she cares, and we’d like to find ways to keep the education effective but shorter (for example, using our printed handouts). Claire could also become more comfortable with insurance terms, so she can answer basic coverage questions in the chair.\n\nGoals for the next review\n1. Stay within 5 minutes of the schedule on 90% of appointments.\n2. Complete the insurance basics training in our online portal.\n3. Lead one lunch-and-learn on caring for anxious patients.\n\nComments\nWe’re thrilled to have Claire on the team!",
